{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Warfront Command</strong> is a turn-based strategy game where players must make crucial tactical decisions to dominate the battlefield. Engage in intense combat and take control of an army, planning each move to outsmart your opponent. With a unique focus on decision-making and strategy, every battle becomes a mental challenge where patience and planning are key to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Turn-based strategy</strong>: Make careful decisions and plan your attacks precisely. Every move matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiplayer mode</strong>: Play against friends or challenge players from around the world in intense battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Striking and detailed graphics</strong>: Enjoy a unique visual design that immerses you in a world full of action and tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Replayability</strong>: Every match is different, providing a unique experience each time you play.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dive into a world of warfare, strategy, and action. The battle is about to begin!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3633570?t=1744301020","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3633570?t=1744301020","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633570/97e1c1f30070e3723862e2895c4c974536a1ba90/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744301020","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633570/97e1c1f30070e3723862e2895c4c974536a1ba90/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744301020","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"descr